      {
        "id": "bb51d9a4-39c1-4125-8de4-568cd5cf499f",
        "name": "Notes",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          0,
          -60
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "color": 4,
          "width": 1400,
          "height": 200,
          "content": "## Webhook Redeliverer (C8 #35)\n\nGitHub never retries a webhook. The Tailscale Funnel ingress occasionally answers 502 (\"failed to connect to host\") before the request reaches this Mac, so every 2 min this lists each repo's pipeline hook deliveries, picks the non-2xx ones from the last hour that were not already redeliveries, and asks GitHub to redeliver each exactly once (Redis key redelivered:{id}, 24 h). Reconciliation for the event path; the poller and the 5-minute merge sweep remain the deeper backups."
        }
      },
